over 2 million meals a year

00:15:11.176 --> 00:15:13.812
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:15:13.812 --> 00:15:15.547
cancer, and other
serious illnesses,

00:15:15.547 --> 00:15:17.316
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:15:17.316 --> 00:15:19.284
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:15:19.284 --> 00:15:22.488
Stay safe. Wear a mask.
Get vaccinated. We love you.

